# Enforce LF line endings for all text files in the repository, regardless of any individual
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. .editorconfig requires LF (end_of_line = lf); this
# file ensures that guarantee holds even when a contributor's local git config would otherwise
# normalize line endings differently.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
